        ("What is optional catch binding in ES2019?", "In ES2019, the error parameter in catch blocks is optional: try { ... } catch { /* no (e) parameter needed */ }.", "Easy", "Practical", "try {\n  JSON.parse(data);\n} catch {\n  return defaultValue;\n}", "When is omitting the error parameter useful?"),
