        ("Can BigInt represent fractional decimal numbers?", "No. BigInt is strictly for whole integers. Division truncates towards zero (5n / 2n === 2n).", "Easy", "Concept", "5n / 2n; // 2n (truncates)", "What does 5 / 2 return with numbers?"),
